---
# Style of the demo files outside demos/tutorial that the documentation
# includes with literalinclude. .pre-commit-config.yaml lists them and
# formats them with this file. The other options come from the
# .clang-format files of the parent directories of each formatted file.
#
# They are formatted at 80 columns, the usual limit of C++ projects,
# which a code block of the documentation shows without scrolling from
# a 1366 px wide window. The root style lets a line overflow by a few
# characters and almost never breaks after "=": both penalties are
# changed so that the limit holds and long right-hand sides move to the
# next line. Comments are not reflowed, so that ASCII diagrams stay
# intact: wrap long comments by hand.
BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig
ColumnLimit: 80
PenaltyBreakAssignment: 10
PenaltyExcessCharacter: 1000
ReflowComments: false
